&_nc_ohc=m3pYIHs1x_gQ7kNvwEjmSME&_nc_oc=AdpNKiTvw9pC0AIFVPxrAQ1jZI6rXNFdikKpj3E5Kzkq3Ez9ZEhVe_zIbmUT4UyGxV0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPscEx2ZuDgAnv5579EAUoSRDVVt7egBTzDnkbbQ3uHFA&oe=6AD3A643"}]}, "id": "4356029028044012", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1471900691162468", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1471900694495801_4829947570561919049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9UHjEegaltQQ7kNvwFQgzJ-&_nc_oc=AdohVV8sWd8ltZ-unOlHTBD2kd0CGHAkiIlKHxF7Wp2Zr0EBCYb1bIb3JvYcbQNeJ1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNWNfpIDs4Xn-n3SfXaK1YdbN-o54LsqARQqGsJLLmYBQ&oe=6AD39CCB"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "1391193859145570", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308010_1391193862478903_5269474807905197381_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1Zy4ep6haxMQ7kNvwHVsAXk&_nc_oc=AdpKZYB60cflq9N89bXgGwgOBTWEAIxyjYnHIn7C7YUmayExvt-BEVvIQ5BL3Ssozxw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO9YMjpTiwy5DBFIzifIzxEc9aco_nt7_gxAV6EqCKRgQ&oe=6AD3B381"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "890412220264365", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_890412223597698_6569410573752295327_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tDcVVEuuLBsQ7kNvwFjDhig&_nc_oc=AdoSB_H9Ej4z5RRlUA6c2SDlXLVo43c4A2loZp6rGCb7_V7Kq-gzy5tLDsMz68qDzBE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNtqrV_qHyp9BHYRYCB98ENJZjCQLvHqT_K8ZP3oBF42g&oe=6AD39484"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "1209432111385989", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_1209432114719322_5500871760126419425_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NpXOTdwAYUgQ7kNvwGohK_H&_nc_oc=Adr36k5EQqKiVGn2jthRHlSW2YgLjHxar6_sIZOdy3GJoMWf90m1NWtGJjv_dy5_zoc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOOo3TIwpIpwkpoIjqaViPou9Osq4d79-9SvK8j7CkJsw&oe=6AD38841"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tD8aecR0XDoQ7kNvwFLK5wn&_nc_oc=AdqlsZvm1vfo5cPruRQqkmUiOchNaelrbCg7Idd2PqAauasVGB7OVmy14C3yrK0GU0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNMDqTsWdqvq6Fbh7dUTtwFFkfXrW6uFUEcF1kXmXMNCw&oe=6AD3B522"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gc-PnOZtA74Q7kNvwF2jkus&_nc_oc=Ado8MdRhEcss8FRZIqBBnOLcs21azwAY1xom1D0BMPu5-RKhOZi0y48nzm1iznPgpBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP9j4Pxk9L5Yg37jzQkvPRPO0ThAoR8MLF2DWIOm_l9Pg&oe=6AD3BB64"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JrHLFCKT9FAQ7kNvwH3e0Rh&_nc_oc=AdpbY2uI9xUuqk1IBG2On6DL9LQHqCX5Xg4l8hAd0HwBLC0Cemo2vlRotm-jLdq0M1I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMS3QOesjhT5unn6N7h21l5rep9J0hybYuGOap5h2I2gw&oe=6AD3BE3C"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NLWMgXsVeHAQ7kNvwGOMGz0&_nc_oc=AdrCciIOhvzBM-6zK-hR2CWtJ9Vi9aTZseWGL209hTiYcnOR-xC0AoSLblvNc5N5FuA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNzGBl0Kj2BXodpUsKEsekERCW4FUFWbRB2ba4TOKd7Yw&oe=6AD3A92E"}, {"file_name": "hero cover cifraria.png", "id": "955328883720100", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_955328887053433_2299564742518944745_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uoA-NVZCHIYQ7kNvwFBgMBq&_nc_oc=AdrpDWab-ZsE6vS15Vl-_pj120FPAYQGRe20WiBXbki_9sbtZo0KZ7jnSiZY5A1fN28&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM8EF4BpbIfIFPVCcwLBGQWEyrtGsKPkKtM_7rnQCaH5Q&oe=6AD3A2C9"}, {"file_name": "cover_cifraria_portrait.png", "id": "923398230271609", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303790_923398233604942_8149238291275724655_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kJC4jHwaVi8Q7kNvwGuZ8Nm&_nc_oc=Adq4Sjz6c_UFYnhoBnmfe0crgOS8icKBlQTEJmyNfy-WMsgmwLShZLWT53jzH54UtNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOqJUTNuz-2CbnSQbecRAwHQLyoml_AJ5kWuEKjUqCrEQ&oe=6AD3B296"}]}, "id": "2120506675398089", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1645036636740857", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_1645036640074190_2595786236772761378_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=76-YDgO_31sQ7kNvwGHaJze&_nc_oc=AdqOJ7kw2hZdparRuW3E4mEYDPH1XbjU_SRvX2yxv2T4IsOeDCadYUdnZiX9QZ81D78&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMb64fm7wnnummSefPZ8F8Fo95U0XIAbJvSaCoN2hA8QA&oe=6AD39E32"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "827413820421285", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_827413823754618_7016173846081243344_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H9O7Zo4yuwkQ7kNvwEch3lz&_nc_oc=AdpPYd4v8S8EZwtuy-3egJ9LNLRa9FIPJAEf8iYBZuG6pGHHguAx6MILMk1FJXC1WTY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN1PlSMbDsfacW7kQTJOM_TcCc0eoGoXYRSPrTkzBKTfg&oe=6AD392E6"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "1684432329357395", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1684432332690728_2661215708382739758_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NsVP5dqzV6wQ7kNvwHqTWx_&_nc_oc=AdrDzFkfi6_1QYCe9eqtKdF_wOfcGh_Z_zE2O1gPUamAv3RU43DH3Bea04i8Sa5ngZE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMkqAYXRXHMrIRN7hM1K7XoR_1XqKVCuItyXZxobAYzeg&oe=6AD396A3"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "991159246965883", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_991159253632549_3726168677936387175_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x4D5f4LLpSoQ7kNvwH5S46l&_nc_oc=AdoJ3F3blkcWnl14eMeZaN1UQHaqZzR_rtvwb_VWGcY1DpgaYhPAzgGE99R7jotmhRQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMAD_QAJ_XdPr3XJO-BslX-ZaFHHe0Wmyn6rdT1eMtwdw&oe=6AD3B6E3"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "966149539200528", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_966149542533861_6133643743596760205_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W32RvsjmEA4Q7kNvwF7cWGs&_nc_oc=Adov6U9GdN-W35oCMjbES5IspGWr0k5MlGC-MgGFtmZoH2p-BuPoYNA3FhXSQ4RWCLk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOMgFRP7AiA-oWYLMb6NOjdpPSF9Rr8okMGCuB7biAS_A&oe=6AD3B638"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Guitar", "Chords", "Songbook", "Lyrics", "Ukulele"], "long_description": "**Cifraria** is a professional song library and guitar chord management application built with Flutter.\n\nDesigned for musicians of all levels, it offers a seamless experience for managing, transposing, and practicing your favorite songs across Mobile and Meta Quest devices.\n\n\u2728 **Features**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Smart Library Architecture**: Organise your songs into custom folders with a glassmorphism sidebar for a premium feel.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Setlist Management**: Create custom lists and organize the songs in the exact order of your performance.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Pro Sharing**: Export your setlists using the exclusive .cifraria extension via messaging apps or use the QR Code so that another device with the app can automatically recreate the list and songs.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Instant Transposition**: Change song keys on the fly with a robust transposition engine.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Cloud Sync (Google Drive)**: Securely backup and restore your entire library, including folders and favorite status.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Meta Quest Ready**: Optimized landscape mode and UI scaling for a distraction-free practice environment in Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Multi-format Import**:  Import songs from the web (one-click extraction) or local files (PDF & DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Interactive Chord Charts**: Clickable chords with automatic diagram generation, supporting both Guitar and Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Performance First**: Local database persistence for instant loading and 100% offline functionality.", "short_description": "Cifraria is a professional song library and guitar chord management application"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18BVoWuGr5oKZaX6z0ZCklOlUod5mBmQH/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David Kalil Braga", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://davidkalil10.github.io/Cifraria_Website/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_g